.TH std::layout_right::mapping::mapping-traits 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::layout_right::mapping::mapping-traits \- std::layout_right::mapping::mapping-traits

.SH Synopsis
static constexpr bool is_unique() noexcept;            \fB(1)\fP (since C++23)
static constexpr bool is_exhaustive() noexcept;        \fB(2)\fP (since C++23)
static constexpr bool is_strided() noexcept;           \fB(3)\fP (since C++23)
static constexpr bool is_always_unique() noexcept;     \fB(4)\fP (since C++23)
static constexpr bool is_always_exhaustive() noexcept; \fB(5)\fP (since C++23)
static constexpr bool is_always_strided() noexcept;    \fB(6)\fP (since C++23)

Every instance of every specialization of mapping is unique, exhaustive, and strided. See
LayoutMapping for the semantics of these predicate mapping traits.

.SH Parameters

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Return value

1-6) true

